=== INERTNESS: capture with sampling ON vs OFF ===
  ok  zb      circle        identical=True
  ok  zb      text.err      identical=True
  -> INERT

case           side       window     used   margin  used%  note
circle         zb              - — NO SAMPLES
text.err       zb              - — NO SAMPLES

window = emulated s bought between RUN and capture; used = to the last change
in the capture region; margin = the rest. Resolution is window/40.
